1.Enable USB debugging on your Android device, connect it to your computer, and use the 'flutter devices' command in your terminal to verify that your device is
detected by Flutter.

Connect Android Device to Flutter
Open Settings → About Phone and tap Build Number 7 times.
Go to Developer Options and enable USB Debugging.
Connect your Android phone to the computer using a USB cable.
Allow the USB debugging permission on your phone.
Open Terminal and run:
flutter devices
Check that your Android device appears in the list.
